      *>================================================================
      *> PROGRAM-ID : ITMDATE
      *> SYSTEM     : STERP - Stefan's ERP
      *> MODULE     : ITEM AND PART MAINTENANCE (STOCK CONTROL)
      *> PURPOSE    : THIN WRAPPER OVER THE COMMON SERVICE DATECALC SO
      *>              THAT A STOCK CONTROL PROGRAM NEVER HAS TWO
      *>              STANDARD COMMAREA HEADERS IN SCOPE AT ONCE.  THE
      *>              DATE RULES THEMSELVES STAY IN DATECALC: THIS
      *>              PROGRAM ONLY MOVES FIELDS.
      *> CALLED BY  : LOTSER, STKMOVE, AVAILQ, ITMIMPCT, THE BATCH
      *>              SUITE.  NOT LINKABLE - IT IS AN INTERNAL
      *>              SUBPROGRAM WITH ITS OWN PARAMETER BLOCK.
      *> INTERFACE  : CALL "ITMDATE" USING ITD-BLOCK  (COPY ITMDATEW)
      *> CALLS      : DATECALC
      *>----------------------------------------------------------------
      *> CHANGE LOG
      *> 1996-10-02 DJM  CR0471 ORIGINAL - DATE HELPER FOR STOCK
      *> 1999-11-30 KMP  Y2K - PASSES 4 DIGIT YEARS STRAIGHT THROUGH
      *> 2026-10-05 STERP REWRITTEN ONTO THE COMMON DATECALC SERVICE
      *>================================================================
      *> REQ: ITM-011
       IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
       PROGRAM-ID. ITMDATE.
       AUTHOR. D J MARSH.
       DATE-WRITTEN. 02/10/1996.
       ENVIRONMENT DIVISION.
       CONFIGURATION SECTION.
       SOURCE-COMPUTER. IBM-PC.
       OBJECT-COMPUTER. IBM-PC.
       DATA DIVISION.
       WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
       COPY DATECALCCA REPLACING ==DFHCOMMAREA== BY ==WS-DATECALC==.
       01  WS-NOW.
           05  WS-NOW-DATE             PIC 9(8).
           05  WS-NOW-REST             PIC X(13).
       LINKAGE SECTION.
       COPY ITMDATEW.
       PROCEDURE DIVISION USING ITD-BLOCK.
       0000-MAIN SECTION.
       0000-ENTRY.
           MOVE 0 TO ITD-RC ITD-NUM-R
           MOVE SPACES TO ITD-MSG
           IF ITD-FUNC = "TODAY"
               MOVE FUNCTION CURRENT-DATE TO WS-NOW
               MOVE WS-NOW-DATE TO ITD-DATE-R
               GO TO 0000-EXIT
           END-IF
           INITIALIZE WS-DATECALC
           MOVE ITD-FUNC TO CA-FUNCTION OF WS-DATECALC
           MOVE "STC" TO CA-COMPANY OF WS-DATECALC
           MOVE "ITM" TO CA-USER OF WS-DATECALC
           MOVE ITD-DATE-1 TO DC-DATE-1
           MOVE ITD-DATE-2 TO DC-DATE-2
           MOVE ITD-NUMBER TO DC-NUMBER
           MOVE "YYYYMMDD" TO DC-FORMAT-IN
           MOVE "DD/MM/YYYY" TO DC-FORMAT-OUT
           CALL "DATECALC" USING WS-DATECALC
           MOVE CA-RETURN-CODE OF WS-DATECALC TO ITD-RC
           MOVE CA-MESSAGE OF WS-DATECALC TO ITD-MSG
           MOVE DC-RESULT-DATE TO ITD-DATE-R
           MOVE DC-RESULT-NUM TO ITD-NUM-R
           MOVE DC-TEXT-OUT TO ITD-TEXT.
       0000-EXIT.
           GOBACK.
